OL,3,AD-Day veteran Donald Howkins dies aged
OL,4,A105
OL,5,
OL,6,FA World War Two veteran who took part
OL,7,Fin the D-Day landings has died aged
OL,8,F105.
OL,10,FDonald Howkins, from Buckingham, served
OL,11,Fas a gunner in the Middlesex Regiment
OL,12,Fand helped waterproof vehicles and
OL,13,Fammunition for the Normandy invasion
OL,14,Fbefore landing at Gold Beach.
OL,16,FHe served alongside his four brothers
OL,17,Fduring the war, all of whom survived.
OL,19,FSpeaking to the BBC in 2024, he said:
OL,20,F"I often wonder why I've lived this
OL,21,Flong and so many of my mates and
OL,22,Ffriends got killed."
